{"id":"n58934-1-8","stage":4,"title":"번번이 · 每次","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58934-1-8-1","ko":"번번이 늦어서 정말 죄송합니다.","zh":"我总是迟到，真的非常抱歉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"번번이","meaning":"每次，屡次，屡屡","explanation":"번번이：每次，屡次，屡屡","readings":[{"term":"번번이","audio":"/audio/b25644d800b8c708d400.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58934","senseId":"1","lemma":"번번이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦어서","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b25644d800b8c708","term":"번번이","zh":"每次，屡次，屡屡","audio":"/audio/b25644d800b8c708d400.mp3","entryId":"58934","definition":"每当事情发生的时候。","pronunciation":["번버니"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5280e3f591453f1b4b0e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58934-1-8-2","ko":"괜찮아요. 앞으로는 주의하세요.","zh":"没关系。以后请多加注意。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮아요.","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞으로는","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주의하세요.","meaning":"注意，留意","explanation":"주의하다：注意，留意；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주의하다","audio":"/audio/41e5cf3b439236528061.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25970","senseId":"1","lemma":"주의하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"41e5cf3b43923652","term":"주의하다","zh":"注意，留意","audio":"/audio/41e5cf3b439236528061.mp3","entryId":"25970","definition":"铭记在心里并加以小心。","pronunciation":["주ː의하다","주ː이하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/07eb6ed6990e1cd44205.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.946,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58934","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7727,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没关系。以后请多加注意。","病人的出血情况很严重。","我总是迟到，真的非常抱歉。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没关系。以后请多加注意。","我总是迟到，真的非常抱歉。","病人的出血情况很严重。"],"answer":0}]}
